# What dart pub publish must never ship. A .pubignore replaces .gitignore for pub, so the usual
# build noise is listed here too. Probe and audit files are throwaway measurements from review
# sessions; audit round 14 found four of them inside the tarball dart pub publish would upload.
.dart_tool/
.packages
build/
.idea/
*.iml
pubspec.lock
test/probe_*
test/audit_*
